# People, deities and groups
#
# A group doing something doesn't mean every member did. The order goes to the guards, one drunk m
# an strikes.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m03_agents> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "People, deities and groups" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E39_Actor

iy:Agent a owl:Class .
iy:Ruler a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Person .
iy:Merchant a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Person .
iy:Artisan a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Person .
iy:Ascetic a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Person .
iy:Dynasty a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Group .
iy:Court a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Group .

iy:memberOf a owl:ObjectProperty .
